Author: poupou97 <nbp85hn@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 30 15:05:16 2026 +0700

    fix(WTM-145): P0 §2 phase 2 — full UI string migration to l10n keys (#70)
    
    * fix(WTM-145): P0 §2 phase 2 — full UI string migration to l10n keys
    
    - Migrate ALL remaining hardcoded user-facing literals in
      lib/features/tongtai/ui/ (19 screens, ~173 VI + bilingual-pipe strings)
      to context.l10n keys: Export, AI key + QR scan, Unified search,
      Onboarding, Home, More, Opportunity detail/feed, Reports, Timeline,
      Chat + chat search, Transaction form, Finance, Goal form/detail/list,
      Customer form
    - AppStrings +110 keys VI/EN + parameterized methods (snackbars, counts,
      subjects) + languageCode accessor for domain-enum labels
    - Kill remaining ' | ' bilingual pipe labels (export, goal form, chat) and
      bilingual two-line empty states (reports, finance, key scan)
    - UI never reads labelVi/labelEn directly anymore — always
      label(context.l10n.languageCode); added labelVi+label() to CustomerSort,
      ProductSort, BusinessEventType; OrderHistoryRange labels now l10n keys
    - ai_key screen no longer bypasses the app language (dropped
      platformDispatcher _lang; follows languageProvider via context.l10n)
    - P0 scan suite extended (3 new permanent locks): ban ' | ' bilingual
      labels · ban ANY Vietnamese literal under ui/ (allowlist: product name)
      · ban direct labelVi/labelEn reads in ui/
    - Update test assertions to single-locale EN values (tests run in EN)
    
    Evidence: flutter analyze clean · 978/978 tests pass
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * ci: retrigger checks
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * ci: add workflow_dispatch fallback trigger
    
    pull_request event delivery stalled on GitHub's side for new branches
    today (#69/#70 never got runs while the workflow is active and earlier
    branches fired normally). A manual dispatch produces the same
    format+analyze+test evidence on GitHub runners.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * docs(WTM-145): CURRENT-STATUS — §2 full-migration entry
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
